    =20

Hi there,

=20

When an AI project disappoints, the first reaction is to blame the model. T=
ry a bigger one, tweak the prompt, add more instructions.

=20

But most of the time the weak link is upstream: where the AI finds the info=
rmation it needs. Chatbot, agent or search, it=E2=80=99s only as good as wh=
at it can retrieve.=20

=20

That=E2=80=99s the job of a **vector database**, which stores your data so =
AI can find what=E2=80=99s relevant by meaning, not just keywords. AWS Mark=
etplace put together a guide on how to choose one.

   =20

[**Download the evaluation guide =E2=80=BA**](https://aws.amazon.com/market=
place/build-learn/vector-databases-for-ai)

=20

**One building block behind three AI patterns:**

* **Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)** pipelines retrieve relevant cont=
ext so your model responds from your data, not its training set.

* **Agentic memory** gives agents semantic recall across sessions instead o=
f replaying conversation histories.

* **Semantic search** matches intent, not keywords.

  =20

All three depend on the same layer: **a vector database**.=20

=20

[Explore what to evaluate for your use case](https://aws.amazon.com/marketp=
lace/build-learn/vector-databases-for-ai):

   =20

1. **Architecture diagrams:** Each pattern mapped with Amazon Bedrock and A=
mazon Bedrock AgentCore

2. **Evaluation framework:** Hybrid search, scaling, hosting trade-offs, em=
bedding pipeline fit, and metadata filtering

3. **Free trials:** Test vector databases in AWS Marketplace and start buil=
ding

   =20

Get the guide and find the right vector database for your stack.

   =20

[**Download the evaluation guide =E2=80=BA**](https://aws.amazon.com/market=
place/build-learn/vector-databases-for-ai)

    =20

  =20

**About AWS Marketplace:**

  =20

[Visit AWS Marketplace](https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace) for help findin=
g the best solutions for your use case and add new capabilities to your tec=
h stack with your AWS account:

   =20

* Tools are designed to plug in to your AWS workflows and integrate with yo=
ur favorite AWS services

* Evaluate fast with free trials and developer-tier pricing to support fast=
 prototyping

* Avoid upfront license fees and pay only for what you use, consolidating b=
illing with your AWS account

* A broad selection of tools across AI, data, observability, security and m=
ore can enhance how you build with AWS

   =20

[**Download the evaluation guide =E2=80=BA**](https://aws.amazon.com/market=
place/build-learn/vector-databases-for-ai)

  =20

